{
  "title": "104: al-Homazah الهمزة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nوَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةِ ۙ‏(1)\nWAYLUL LEKULLE HOMAZATIL LOMAZATE. NIL\nWoe to every slanderer, defamer, \nاۨلَّذِىْ جَمَعَ مَالًا وَّعَدَّدَهٗ ۙ‏(2)\nLAZEE JAMA-A’ MAALAWN WA A’DDADAHU. \nWho amasses wealth and considers it a provision (against mishap); \nيَحْسَبُ اَنَّ مَالَهٗۤ اَخْلَدَهٗ‌ ۚ‏(3)\nYAHSABO ANNA MAALAHU AKHLADAH. \nHe thinks that his wealth will make him immortal. \nكَلَّا‌ لَيُنْۢبَذَنَّ فِى الْحُطَمَةِ ۖ‏(4)\nKALLAA LAYUMBAZANNA FIL HOTAMATE. \nNay! he shall most certainly be hurled into the crushing disaster, \nوَمَاۤ اَدْرٰٮكَ مَا الْحُطَمَةُ ؕ‏(5)\nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAL-HOTAMAH. \nAnd what will make you realize what the crushing disaster is? \nنَارُ اللّٰهِ الْمُوْقَدَةُ ۙ‏(6)\nNAARUL LAAHIL MOOQADAUL. \nIt is the fire kindled by Allah, \nالَّتِىْ تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى الْاَفْئِدَةِ ؕ‏(7)\nLATEE TAT-TA-LE-O’ A’LAL AF-EDAH. \nWhich rises above the hearts. \nاِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِمْ مُّؤْصَدَةٌ ۙ‏(8)\nINNAHAA A’LAYHIM MOOSADATUN. \nSurely it shall be closed over upon them, \nفِىْ عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ‏(9)\nFEE A’MADIM MOMADDADAH.\nIn extended columns. ",
  "merits": "Surah al-Homazah (The Slanderer)\nThis Surah was revealed in Makkah and it has 9 verses. The Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that the reward for reciting this Surah can be compared to ten times the number of disbelievers who were present in Makkah.\nReciting Surah al-Homazah in compulsory prayers keeps a person safe from poverty. Sustenance comes towards him. His death will not be of a sudden and terrifying nature. This Surah is also a cure for pain in the eyes and should be recited before blowing gently into the eyes for relief from pain. Keeping this Surah in a talisman around one’s neck acts as a protection from the ‘evil eye’."
